msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"Hey, how are you feeling? You know I'm ready to fight any\r\n"
"time, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Oh, by the way, let me give you some good info..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "I saw a guy win a fight once without ever being hit once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"This might sound obvious, but it just doesn't look good if\r\n"
"you get knocked down by an opponent's attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"The crowd's interest will instantly shift to your opponent,\r\n"
"and the momentum will start flowing in his favor, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"So avoid big, swinging punches meant to knock you down.\r\n"
"Sounds basic, I know, but it's key."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "I'll let you know if anything else comes up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"It wasn't the first time the crowd had seen a good fighter,\r\n"
"but, man, were they surprised!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
